  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "The desired probability\r\n\r\n$=\\frac{\\frac{10}{100} \\times \\frac{70}{100}}{\\frac{10}{100} \\times \\frac{70}{100}+\\frac{5}{100} \\times \\frac{30}{100}}=\\frac{14}{17}$",
